LEGAL COMPLIANCE, FAIR USE & INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY SAFE HARBOR
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

1. TRADEMARK AND COPYRIGHT ACKNOWLEDGEMENT:
   "Hay Day" and "Supercell" are registered trademarks of Supercell Oy. This
   repository is an independent, community-driven educational research and
   accessibility automation project. This project is NOT affiliated with,
   endorsed by, maintained by, or sponsored by Supercell Oy or any of its
   affiliates.

2. FAIR USE DEFENSE & NON-COMMERCIAL EDUCATIONAL RESEARCH:
   This software is distributed strictly under the doctrine of Fair Use
   (17 U.S.C. § 107) for private, non-commercial educational research, computer
   vision algorithm benchmarking, and automated Android Accessibility testing.
   No proprietary Supercell server code, private intellectual property, or
   game server infrastructure is hosted, redistributed, or monetized herein.

3. DMCA SAFE HARBOR & NO CIRCUMVENTION CLAUSE:
   This software operates purely at the user-space and accessibility interface
   layer via the official Google Android Debug Bridge (ADB) input dispatching
   protocol. It does NOT bypass any digital rights management (DRM), cryptographic
   access controls, or digital locks (17 U.S.C. § 1201).

4. DMCA TAKEDOWN DEFENSE & COUNTER-NOTICE PROCEDURE:
   Any copyright holder or representative issuing a DMCA notice regarding this
   repository must submit verified identification and explicit legal justification
   prior to frivolous automated claims. Unlawful automated takedown attempts are
   subject to statutory damages under 17 U.S.C. § 512(f).
